    <block id="100">
      <lang code="CHN">
        <font>$local$\fonts\fonthead16bld.fnt</font>
        <text>
任务失败！
</text>
        <font>$local$\fonts\font12.fnt</font>
        <picture>$local$\graphics\Hero_Dead_F.pcx</picture>
        <text>

是英勇，还是鲁莽？比雅尼陨落之时，诸神落泪……少了这位英雄，任务的结局将永远对你隐藏。
</text>
      </lang>
      <lang code="eng">
        <text>
MISSION LOST!

Heroism or recklessness? When BJARNI died, the gods wept... Without this hero, the end of the mission will remain hidden from you.
</text>
      </lang>
      <lang code="ger">
        <font>$local$\fonts\fonthead16bld.fnt</font>
        <text>
